$ positional --help
usage: positional INPUT [SCALE] [--verbose] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]

Positional arguments:
  INPUT
      Input file
  SCALE
      default value 1.0
      Scale factor

Optional switches:
  --verbose
      default value .false.
      Verbose
  --help, -h
      Print this help message
  --markdown, -md
      Save this help message in a Markdown file
  --version, -v
      Print version
